  << /ActualText (I\047m a motion designer and art director\054 born in New York and based in Long Beach\054 California\056 I work freelance and I\047m currently an Associate Creative Director at Monks\056 Before that I was a motion designer at Entropico\054 working on Google Ads\054 Google Next and YouTube campaigns\056 I\047ve also worked with agencies like Code \053 Theory\054 Dada Goldberg\054 Imprint Projects and BYTE New York\054 for brands including Google\054 Amazon\054 Spotify\054 AT\046T and HP\056)
